  "campo": "sinopsis.en",
  "valor": "A list, far too long, of Algerian immigrants murdered in France in 1975 opens this avant-garde essay on the invisible workers who keep Paris running and the structures that exploit them. Images repeated to the rhythm of manual labor, precarious homes set against their employers' residences, the crowded subway at dawn.",
